    "body": "@bzbarsky We are working through the related issue from Navigation Timing here at TPAC and we are wondering about how this issue affects \"serviceworker bits\". Could you be a little more explicit? Thank you!\r\n\r\n@toddreifsteck thinks that you are potentially referring to https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/FetchEvent/isReload ? But that appears to be removed from the spec. \r\n\r\nCan you help us out? Thank you!",
