    "created_at": "2019-09-17T06:34:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-17T06:34:54Z",
    "body": "FetchEvent.isReload was replaced by Request.isReloadNavigation:\r\nhttps://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-request-isreloadnavigation \r\n\r\nFor this issue it sounds like Request.isHistoryNavigation (https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-request-ishistorynavigation) is more relevant. \r\n\r\nI'm here at TPAC too. I would guess that it should count as a back navigation. This would have been a good issue for the Service Worker WG yesterday. cc @asutherland @jakearchibald  @wanderview @youennf",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
