    "created_at": "2019-09-17T06:37:13Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-17T06:37:13Z",
    "body": "The main use case of isReloadNavigation and isHistoryNavigation was so the service worker can choose to more heavily use cached responses on a back navigation (user is just going back) or more heavily go to network for a reload (user is trying to get a fresh version of the page).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
