    "created_at": "2019-09-17T06:58:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-17T06:58:39Z",
    "body": "> For this issue it sounds like Request.isHistoryNavigation (https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-request-ishistorynavigation) is more relevant.\r\n\r\nYes, exactly.  What value do service workers see for `isHistoryNavigation` for the post-redirect request if the pre-redirect request was caused by a history operation?",
